<title>USA: EIA Monthly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</title>
<headline>EIA Monthly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</headline>
<text>
<p>U.S. PROPANE STOCKS (IN MILLION BARRELS)</p>
<p>		 08/31/96   07/31/96   08/95   07/95   Change/Mo</p>
<p>East Coast	 4.3	 5.0	5.1	4.1	- 0.7</p>
<p>Midwest	   23.0	20.7     23.1     19.8	+ 2.3</p>
<p>Gulf Coast	20.7	20.3     26.1     24.8	+ 0.4</p>
<p>U.S. Total	49.6	47.5     55.9     50.1	+ 2.1</p>
<p>Source: Estimates by U.S. Department of Energy's Energy Information Administration. EIA will report propane stocks on a monthly basis from May to September.</p>
<p>- Totals may not equal sum of regions due to rounding.</p>
</text>
